# 必考词 Unit 04 短语

## 常考短语

- **the bulk of**: 大部分 — The bulk of the population lives in cities. 大部分人口住在城市。
- **burst into**: 突然开始 — She burst into tears when she heard the news. 听到消息她突然哭了起来。
- **be capable of**: 有能力做 — He is capable of solving difficult problems. 他有能力解决难题。
- **capture one's attention**: 吸引注意力 — The headline captured my attention. 标题吸引了我的注意力。
- **casual clothing**: 休闲服装 — You can wear casual clothing to the party. 你可以穿休闲服去参加聚会。
- **cease to do/doing**: 停止做 — The company ceased to operate last year. 公司去年停止运营了。
- **challenge sb. to sth.**: 向某人挑战 — He challenged me to a game of chess. 他向我挑战下棋。
- **in charge of**: 负责 — Who is in charge of this project? 谁负责这个项目？
- **take charge of**: 接管 — She took charge of the department. 她接管了这个部门。
- **charge sb. with sth.**: 指控某人某事 — He was charged with theft. 他被指控盗窃。
- **in the circumstances**: 在这种情况下 — In the circumstances, we had no choice. 在这种情况下，我们别无选择。
- **under no circumstances**: 在任何情况下都不 — Under no circumstances should you open this door. 任何情况下都不要打开这扇门。
- **cite…as**: 引用…作为 — He was cited as an example of success. 他被引用为成功的例子。
- **make a claim**: 提出索赔 — She made a claim for damages. 她提出了损害索赔。
- **lay claim to**: 声称对…有权利 — He laid claim to the property. 他声称对那处房产有权利。
- **cast doubt on**: 对…产生怀疑 — The new evidence cast doubt on his story. 新证据对他的说法产生了怀疑。
- **cancel out**: 抵消 — The gains cancel out the losses. 收益抵消了损失。
- **build up**: 逐步建立 — She built up a successful business. 她逐步建立了一家成功的企业。
- **bear a burden**: 承担负担 — He bears the burden of supporting his family. 他承担着养家的重担。
- **a matter of course**: 理所当然的事 — Checking references is a matter of course in hiring. 核查推荐信是招聘中的例行公事。
